+	    "/Library/Wallpaper/Collections/iOS_17~iphone.wallpaperCollection/Wallpapers/7565.iOS_17-393w-852h@3x~iphone.wallpaper/" "7565.iOS_17_Floating-393w-852h@3x~iphone.ca/Blue-Light.png",
